> To drop the specified prefix from the variable names in the newly created DataFrame, you can use the `replace` function along with a simple broadcast operation. Here’s how you can do this, continuing from the previous example:
> 
> ```julia
> using DataFrames
> 
> # Example DataFrame
> original_df = DataFrame(
>     "year0:factor(REGION_4LETTER)SERB" => 1:5,
>     "year0:factor(REGION_4LETTER)SING" => 6:10,
>     "another_column" => 11:15
